# TIP-054.4b-R27 consolidated verification

2026-10-10 · Contractor · **Approved broker continuation VERIFIED locally; wider R27 PARTIAL / NOT READY.**

The Homeowner's “chốt và triển khai” decision has been implemented: a host-owned
broker controls admitted qualifying artifacts and streams; platform transcripts
are separately retained, disclosed audit outside that packet. This boundary is
approved and pinned, not another decision awaiting approval. It does not grant
SQL/Docker/HTTP/load, external processing, Git writes/rebuild or executor activation.

The supported cooperative producer/fixed-child implementation is independently
accepted. R21 SLA FAILED/P1, EXE-009 OPEN/P1, candidate NOT_READY, serving executor
OFF and TIP-054.5 BLOCKED remain unchanged. This work improves evidence ownership
and lifecycle correctness; no product latency repair or release certification occurred.

